# Fae Flight has flash and "Enchant creature" is not limited to your own: on Bot2's turn 2 Bot1 casts it onto Bot2's Memnite once it has resolved (CR 702.8a, 303.4).
# The Memnite is a 2/1 with flying and hexproof until the end of that turn, then just flying, and it stays Bot2's (controlling the Aura is not controlling the creature).

